\mathbb E[e^{kY}]
=B\sum_{n\in\mathbb Z}e^{kn-n^2/2}
=Be^{k^2/2}\sum_{n\in\mathbb Z}e^{-(n-k)^2/2}.
$$
Translation by the integer $k$ merely permutes the summation indices, so the final sum is $B^{-1}$. Consequently
