\ddot\delta+2H\dot\delta
-c_s^2\frac1{a^2}(\nabla^2+k_J^2)\delta=0,
\qquad
k_J^2=\frac{4\pi Gm\bar n a^2}{c_s^2}}.
$$
Here $k_J$ is the comoving <Jeans wavenumber>.

