\qquad
(\Delta N)^2=\frac{\partial^2\log\mathcal Z}
{\partial(\beta\mu)^2}=\langle N\rangle.
$$
Thus
$$
\frac{\Delta N}{\langle N\rangle}
=\frac1{\sqrt{\langle N\rangle}},
$$
which vanishes in the thermodynamic limit.

