e^{-\beta\epsilon(p)}\,d^3p.
$$
Classical particle counting still gives
$$
\mathcal Z=\exp(e^{\beta\mu}q_1^{\rm rel}),\qquad
\langle N\rangle=e^{\beta\mu}q_1^{\rm rel},
