$$
The closure of $C_n\times\mathbb R$ is
$\overline{C_n}\times\mathbb R$, which has empty interior because $\overline{C_n}$ has empty interior. Each product is therefore nowhere dense, so $A$ is meagre in $\mathbb R^2$.

